{"version":1,"key":"card:298","content":{"id":298,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise.race","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法接收一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 组成的数组，返回一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当数组中有任一 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的状态变为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolved","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rejected","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，返回的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就会相应的变为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolved","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rejected","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。正如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"race","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 所暗示的，是多个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在竞争，最终选择最快的那个"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const promise1 = new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    resolve(1);\n  }, 1000);\n});\n\nconst promise2 = Promise.resolve({\n  then(resolve, reject) {\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      resolve(2);\n    }, 2000);\n  },\n});\n\n// promise1 会率先执行 resolve，所以得到的结果是promise1 传递的结果\nPromise.race([promise1, promise2]).then((data) => {\n  console.log(data); // 1\n});","language":"js","uuid":"7ac0a221-46ec-41d6-ac03-e897ea0d505d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Promise"],"createTime":1692198203304,"updateTime":1743303640424,"linkedCards":[{"id":285,"target":{"key":"card:285","type":"card","id":285},"summary":"JavaScript 是单线程的，为了不阻塞线程，很多方法都是异步的，通过回调函数的形式来处理函数结果，这就会带来一个问题，当回调特别多时，代码的可读性急剧下降 getUser(function(user) { getOrders(user...","tags":["JavaScript/Promise"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640424}}